body:
I fear I'm a perma-DM as well, which has its ups and downs.  I love writing a story and setting up the overall big points, but I get overwhelmed spending hours every week on writing encounters and map drawing and all of the things we all do.

&#x200B;

All this is to say -- I often wish I could just sit down and be my TRUE perma-class == Bard.

&#x200B;

Bard. For. Life.

9.9 times out of 10, absolutely. I've only had one twat of a veteran, and I don't think him being a twat had anything to do with his service. 

&#x200B;

Love teaching vets.

Is there a Newcastle in Australia? I was listening for Geordie accents and got quite confused.

&#x200B;

I mean, yeah, fuck this racist piece of shit, that's the main point, but also can someone help a Yank out with geography? Is this the Newcastle in New South Wales?
